From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: CAPTURE的S_FMT不再把解码裁剪冲成缓冲尺寸

iris_vdec_s_fmt()的CAPTURE分支把inst->crop重置成S_FMT的尺寸。iris只有这一个矩形，
CROP和COMPOSE两类目标读的都是它。v4l2_codec2按G_FMT、S_FMT、G_SELECTION(COMPOSE)
的顺序取格式，于是固件在SEQUENCE_CHANGED里报告的裁剪被覆盖：H.264的1920x1080
报成1920x1088，底部多出8行。

stateful解码规范（dev-decoder.rst）里，设置CAPTURE格式会把compose重置成默认值，
而COMPOSE_DEFAULT等于CROP，也就是码流的可见区域，不是缓冲尺寸。所以这里不用动
inst->crop：它在OUTPUT的S_FMT时取初值，收到SEQUENCE_CHANGED时更新。

venus的vdec_s_fmt()也有同样的重置，这里只改iris。

---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c
index b638d58c3..55cfd2be0 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c
@@ -299,11 +299,6 @@ int iris_vdec_s_fmt(struct iris_inst *inst, struct v4l2_format *f)
 		fmt->fmt.pix_mp.plane_fmt[0].sizeimage = iris_get_buffer_size(inst, BUF_OUTPUT);
 		inst->buffers[BUF_OUTPUT].min_count = iris_vpu_buf_count(inst, BUF_OUTPUT);
 		inst->buffers[BUF_OUTPUT].size = fmt->fmt.pix_mp.plane_fmt[0].sizeimage;
-
-		inst->crop.top = 0;
-		inst->crop.left = 0;
-		inst->crop.width = f->fmt.pix_mp.width;
-		inst->crop.height = f->fmt.pix_mp.height;
 		break;
 	default:
 		return -EINVAL;
